    <h2>One-paragraph bio (for direct quotation)</h2>
    <p style="background:var(--bg-alt);padding:1.5rem 1.75rem;border-left:3px solid var(--gold-500);border-radius:0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;margin:1rem 0 2rem;font-size:0.98rem;line-height:1.7">
      Pikes Peak Web Designs is a Colorado-based agency building custom-coded websites for small service businesses across the U.S. and Canada. Founded by Jon Ajinga in Colorado Springs, the agency rejects the WordPress / page-builder / template-mill model in favor of hand-written code on the modern edge: 95&ndash;100 PageSpeed scores, WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility, hand-written schema for the local-pack, and a flat $175/month plan with $0 down (or a $4,000 lump-sum) instead of a five-thousand-dollar design deposit. The whole agency operates in public &mdash; live changelog, open service agreement, public Owner's Guide &mdash; so prospective clients can evaluate the work before any sales conversation.
    </p>

