      Jon Ajinga is the founder of <a href="https://pikespeakwebdesigns.com" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Pikes Peak Web Designs</a>, a Colorado Springs agency that builds custom-coded websites for small service businesses across the U.S. and Canada. He writes about local SEO, page speed, and the hidden cost of "good enough" templates for the trades.
